  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Predicting Impacts of Cyclones in South-East Africa (PICSEA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research grant &#x2013; developing the most comprehensive assessment of forecast systems to date for tropical cyclones and their effects on southeast Africa, in order for forecasters, humanitarian agencies and the forecastbased finance community to be able to respond appropriately to tropical cyclone hazard. Benefitting local communities through improved resilience. SDGs: 13.</narrative>
  </description>
